+    be the parts concatenated in the same order the anchor bank used -- otherwise
+    the moving-vertex mask selects the wrong half of the model. Rather than trust a
+    pre-fused asset, the parts are concatenated here and the result replaces the
+    registered mesh, which is the only way the two orderings are guaranteed to
